{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1e1d1698d9b25d73fec4a6cd5cdb1cc13948cbf4bd3b41cd829227e10d5996d4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_39bec43c0ee2896cb0f6935da85c19f36cc678d86f658a9d51543f0e52d01b0c","slc_522bc1702edf105055318d32601c464ae982f90e239a5df17c28b94bd875734b","slc_88197d6fb6bec498e5c685d2f1173a3179e992bb10db7a82a262b87eeb03e361"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"The harness API offers three tiers: cascadeflow.init(mode=\"observe\") for zero-change tracking, cascadeflow.run(budget=..., max_tool_calls=...) sessions with summary() and trace(), and a @cascadeflow.agent decorator accepting budget, compliance, and KPI weights.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_231d49f38fa674438b63ed81870c72d683bbaeb8a244a74cc71e880751107f4f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e88d783ad5a36b6f2072cfc714ca9017cea451ae33daed381930a2a0fb85117f"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"GPT-5 streaming requires OpenAI organization verification, while non-streaming GPT-5 works for all users; basic examples work without verification since GPT-5 is only called when needed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_329a04d23f32e682d8a5bb4fe175a0a49de9f90baf8ac4b92fafd9a4b3fe54d4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_43df36dbab88620c5fb6001280c89016d82726df80200c5fdcbb13c5aa66f965"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"The README reports benchmark-based cost savings of 69% on MT-Bench, 93% on GSM8K, 52% on MMLU, and 80% on TruthfulQA while retaining 96% GPT-5 quality.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_59db4708848d5fae7af17a22cb1146fba3f487cdb1ca2146967a7ee43ff2afa8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_61d8b50a0e591753d0bad2d19c6dafce22c7007013c0ceada65dbd8bdd8cf5db","slc_d9036850a26e9fb2eb63ba5641ca61054d6236b1d1e6a2b276a2a1e4200ca21d","slc_f18d272561955586f3acff79b95daac5cce0ea7396a64a6023ee542531ef9b2f"],"source_ids":["src_db7ff6322863554684b358606cb2b467"],"text":"The repository is a pnpm/Turborepo monorepo with a Python package and a TypeScript packages/core library; the TypeScript library is described as an MVP supporting only the OpenAI provider.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_650e40919bad9bc58ecb009b7e7abec0cf7b6bd1c3ff193cbd986c41e8cfae46","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a378cd747d1d77d4359522eda0278fd9033a3961d28f33625ed9f66fb99adbba"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"At runtime the harness can enforce decisions with four actions: allow, switch_model, deny_tool, and stop, based on current context and policy state.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_75614c2ff2fd8bcd4b4b1aca27120f9d8809b95a9f9c29763473896fcb64b32b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_04963878538bc3d1eb5b54ed8a1ac3950e0dee156562361863ed1e991251cf03","slc_30059f83045c7ddbc203d07141467b630056c47a7aeab06cb3eb9678c1fc5ad5","slc_5536671aff94975a2296379883d245dea912de9292deb0e144b4dcc24d2467d6"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"The Hermes integration exposes HermesDelegationRouter and HermesDelegationRequest, returning a structured routing decision (reason, confidence, domain, complexity, model) before Hermes spawns a subagent, while Hermes keeps credentials, base URLs, and fallback chains.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a749448530b64115cb7a22d572bf71f69a51f234046be065a86a8f7b8532d7a9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0c8bedbecb785845b27c98fa19190e3ee89563f6370e4f004181de437d24542c","slc_55fa19d40a1834537dfd53ddca7a54447738dc7be19fe75553217cdeeee156d9","slc_8c441b6c73a02fa58f90ec1a280920df8cd4849211c6e361346a6bfacd6e7402"],"source_ids":["src_db7ff6322863554684b358606cb2b467"],"text":"CascadeAgent (agent.py) is the main orchestrator and entry point for all queries, exposing run, run_streaming, and stream_events and coordinating routing, cost calculation, metrics, and callbacks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ac723b9c4e4dbb6552dde2862cc9d1013bf6ce726fe9214be03f9524f730f63f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d980ce99172ed468df93c46ecfbc87f4a95a4e0c81d1734da3b000dc33784bf","slc_806885e17e4a9b8ef181b0dfdd63999be64a7ea97f32c047f3caaf3401d94642"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"cascadeflow is positioned as an in-process intelligence layer operating inside the agent execution loop rather than at the HTTP request boundary like external proxies.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d21b758dfb2ab084ea5668c40b8111cae9360a3e726c0cf1d78d8197bf184aa2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1a8f217a2c5cf13b0d2a20bcaa9a140a0c15e4e7a9eb8dc2d6b4cb9d5837659f","slc_6788882f08dfbfb7f168226027c26af972d580316fae18317c19a00393fa95e4"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"A drop-in gateway for existing OpenAI/Anthropic clients can be started with 'python -m cascadeflow.server --mode auto --port 8084'.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dd4f84a04013e3473b26f875b20b99b9520b69335ed1142f69b8ca6c882299e1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_da6339dacf355ccf83f69c0c26f3ac0804102803322fc9c340226e082dbc7998","slc_f2c3b4ed916268548e0a456ef36e159f7d390661e78951b72d79468360eab114"],"source_ids":["src_db7ff6322863554684b358606cb2b467"],"text":"WholeResponseCascade is described as the core cascade execution engine, with an execute(query, drafter, verifier) method that runs the speculative cascade.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e6a7c744c8bae06c0de0284053194c022af1f65f2bed1cfc23ac739f5200a839","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0c7be359784ef02a93889db7a127b7e775eee85f1b339397f3fb405a60a835a0","slc_33397002285015599e2fe2c78b3999b2ab28e39a0ffa1bfa298f10c1d81d2a14","slc_8d649cef60f9be8b5a8667b6d315eef11b4ba3601618c2768c280bfb1336f34b"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22","src_db7ff6322863554684b358606cb2b467"],"text":"The core mechanism is speculative execution with quality validation: run a cheap drafter first, validate responses against configurable thresholds, and escalate to a larger model only when validation fails.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e79390dea62e5dc89e2dd661c9209b7e88afff7ff5de9e4ea2a6d65031ce9a30","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_227af6528f617dcdf7688e316a9052b8f961906c67a60d27081f38eb76b8f764","slc_22c9dca9dcc723931e7c45cf97b8f45de56762acf19eeea9f898de1bcc95fec7","slc_a10d4228555cc1f57fa2f8504aeee71ed2f773e8505ca86d24bf7fedaa8435cb"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"ML-based semantic quality validation is optional: Python via cascadeflow[semantic] (FastEmbed, ~80MB model) and TypeScript via @cascadeflow/ml with @huggingface/transformers (BGE-small-en-v1.5 embeddings, auto-downloaded).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ed6f8462c639ef3299732d00dbe13fb75379e32d87313b344511a0d45a778ee3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"lemony-ai/cascadeflow@d8251001a51c snapshot 75606ca846a6a60c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_197ea6cf712d48de517bc3df0b51973c77c7ebb1dd0ffcdb20ec5fe073596c69","slc_9269776acf19e68fd0093bdb3b0cff9402ddc3e2d99df55d9810b410b09a23d1"],"source_ids":["src_4e7fb2ca145e59549b3c6c8f9fdd1c22"],"text":"The n8n integration provides two community nodes: a CascadeFlow (Model) sub-node drop-in for Chain/LLM nodes and a standalone CascadeFlow Agent node supporting tool calling, memory, and multi-step reasoning.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_68ceab55c4f742a08dd575dcbebf2489"}
